  "unmatched_join_rows targets are parent-side (parent rows without children) plus nullable child FKs; PK columns are never nulled; parent-side unmatched is enforced by reserving at least one generated parent PK excluded from every child FK pool",
  "results.laps and results.milliseconds are declared TEXT but constrained to integer ranges; the generator samples them as integers and stores as text; boundary emission is suppressed for these columns to respect the semantic range rules",
